    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Echoes of the House</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0410 short, linear psychological horror game that plunges the player into a haunting mystery. The story follows Christopher, who arrives at his grandmother's remote countryside home for what should be an ordinary visit. However, strange occurrences quickly reveal that nothing is as it seems, with the eerie atmosphere building as players uncover deeper, unsettling layers to the narrative. The game uses psychological tension to create a chilling and immersive experience. All within a one-hour playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game mainly features a first-person narrative experience that involves exploration, conversations, and engaging\u00a0gameplay elements.<br><br><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229140/extras/4a144279eae2f29416ffe4b57a7bea68.poster.avif?t=1750916737\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229140/extras/4a144279eae2f29416ffe4b57a7bea68.webm?t=1750916737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229140/extras/4a144279eae2f29416ffe4b57a7bea68.mp4?t=1750916737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A deeply unsettling atmosphere where tension builds as reality distorts, keeping players on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Experience:</strong> A focused, one-hour experience with a tight narrative, delivering a powerful and immersive story without distractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Rural Setting:</strong> Explore an eerie, isolated countryside house filled with secrets that unravel the further you investigate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Twists:</strong> The story goes beyond what meets the eye, offering surprising revelations and hidden depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This makes the game perfect for horror fans seeking a quick yet intense and story-rich experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes artificial intelligence\u00a0voiceovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
